Imported facts, the complete September 2026 standalone database ZIP (including source SQL),
and historical API snapshots come from the US National Highway Traffic Safety
Administration (NHTSA) vPIC. Each active source is identified in data/dataset.json.
The original ZIP is unmodified. Runtime projection joins WMI/make associations, normalizes
label whitespace, uppercases brands and records exclusions; see data/nhtsa/metadata.json.
